window.products.push({"id":427137,"name":"Spode Christmas Tree 5-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+3ADsoOL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Product Description A festive way to infuse holiday gatherings with a sense of elegance, this enchanting five-piece dinnerware set includes one place setting comprised of a 10-1/2-inch dinner plate, a 7-3/4-inch salad plate, a 6-1/4-inch bread-and-butter plate, a 5-1/2-inch saucer, and a 7-ounce tea cup. A gracefully curved handle allows guests to easily sip cocoa or cider from the tea cup and rest it neatly on the saucer to prevent damage to tabletops, while the plates recess slightly at the center to prevent spills while filling up at the buffet. Furthermore, the collector-worthy set looks as beautiful displayed in an open cabinet or glass-front hutch as it does spread across the table for Christmas dinner. Crafted of durable earthenware with rich green banding, the set brings the appearance of fine china with the resilience of more practical tableware to family meals and other social events. Vibrantly colored Christmas trees--complete with ornament-festooned boughs and piles of wrapped gifts--adorn each milk-white piece, with the saucer sporting a scattering of holly leaves and mistletoe sprigs that match the tasteful design accenting the tea cup's interior. Best of all, the classic pattern layers attractively with complementary table linens, and it coordinates perfectly with matching serveware and other pieces from Spode's classic Christmas Tree collection (sold separately). Safe for use in the microwave and dishwasher, the dinnerware set offers versatility and distinction while entertaining throughout the winter holidays. What's in the Box 1 place setting consisting of: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 7-3/4-inch salad plate; 6-1/4-inch bread-and-butter plate; 5-1/2-inch saucer; 7-ounce tea cup. 5 pieces total. Amazon.com Dating back to 1938, Spode Christmas Tree dinnerware creates an air of gentle merriment with an image of a lovingly decorated evergreen. In this five-piece place setting, the tree is repeated in careful detail on every piece. Its bright colors, festive ornaments, old-fashioned presents, and charming Santa figure are both cheering and enduring. Sprigs of holly and mistletoe and wide green banding form tasteful accents. Service for one, this set includes a 10-1/2-inch dinner plate, a 7-3/4-inch salad plate, a 6-1/4-inch bread and butter plate, a 5-1/2-inch saucer, and a 7-ounce teacup. Each piece is crafted from durable earthenware that is safe in the microwave and dishwasher. Christmas Tree accessories and oven-to-table serving pieces are also available. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 1 place setting. Each place setting consists of: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 7-3/4-inch salad plate; 6-1/4-inch bread and butter plate; 5-1/2-inch saucer; 7-ounce teacup. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+3ADsoOL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spode","source_asin":"B078JGL5DN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JGL5DN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JGL5DN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
