window.products.push({"id":427205,"name":"7Pandas Electric Gooseneck Kettle with 5 Temperature Control, Pour Over Kettle for Brewing Coffe and Tea, 100% Stainless Steel, 0.8L (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mpQiw2TNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOOSENECK SPOUT: This kettle adopts gooseneck-style water outlet design, which can be precisely controlled during the dumping process. The elongated opening can greatly control the water flow, thereby providing a stable and predictable dumping effect. The precision pouring port is designed to achieve the best pouring flow rate. The ergonomic ear-shaped handle design provides a comfortable and safe grip to avoid burns when pouring boiling water. STAINLESS STEEL: The body, spout, and lid are all made of natural BPA-free food-grade stainless steel. It does not contain Teflon or chemical coating to maintain the pure taste of coffee and tea; it is durable, does not rust, and is easy to clean. No plastic inside, safe and sanitary, no precipitation, to ensure the pure taste of the water. TEMP CONTROL: Temperature control (180°F-212°F) accurate to the degree, you can personalize your perfect coffee or tea every time. It extracts rich aroma and subtle flavor, and is used to brew coffee, French filter press, green tea and other brewed beverages. SAFE DESIGN: With Famous British STRIX thermostat, the kettle will be auto shut off when it reaches your desired tempeature or you also could turn it off by long pressing the temp button for 3 seconds; The overheat and dry boil protection feature will turn kettle off when it detects there is no water in side to keep you safe. QUICK BOIL: 1000W high-power rapid heating, three-dimensional ring heating mode, allowing the water to heat up quickly from bottom to top, and the full pot can be boiled in 4-6 minutes, allowing you to enjoy coffee in a short time, saving you in front of the dining table or stove Waiting time or microwave oven. 30 minutes heat preservation function, provide hot water at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mpQiw2TNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"7 PANDAS","source_asin":"B07WFD99M5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFD99M5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFD99M5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
