window.products.push({"id":427211,"name":"AYFLOR Bamboo Utensils, Sustainable Bamboo Travel Utensil Set with Carrying Case, Fork, Spoon, Knife, Chopsticks, Straw, Excellent for Everyday Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71auNRCtWsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is estimated that close to 40billion individual plastic utensils are produced each year with most of themending up in our landfills, beaches and oceans. In fact, with such low rates ofreuse and recycling, plastics are likely to remain untouched for hundreds ofthousands of years! It’s still not too late. If you want tobe effective, you don’t need to shell out millions of dollars, nor live offgrid and become a homesteader. In your own little way, you can do your share inhelping the environment. And one place you can start is in your kitchen, andthe utensils you use. Start your zero-waste journey todaywith AYFLOR Bamboo Travel Utensil Set With the current global trend of shyingaway from plastic products, plastic is being slowly replaced by wooden, or themore sustainable bamboo utensils. Why is bamboo the better choice? First, it grows in most places aroundthe globe, making it very sustainable. Second, its fibers are tough and canwithstand applied force several times its own weight. And lastly, its superlightweight and portable. Why make the shift from metal andplastic travel cutlery and choose AYFLOR Bamboo travel utensils? Our products are made with 100% natural bamboo, making them safe for you and your family. Our products are made with 100% natural bamboo, making them safe for you and your family. Sustainably harvested and made from 5-year-old mature bamboo plants. Sustainably harvested and made from 5-year-old mature bamboo plants. Manufactured to last years without warping or breaking. Manufactured to last years without warping or breaking. No action is too small when it comes to helping save mother nature. Add the AYFLOR Bamboo travel utensils to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71auNRCtWsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYFLOR","source_asin":"B07VNR3W67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNR3W67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNR3W67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
