window.products.push({"id":427244,"name":"KOZYFLY Boho Rug Runners for Hallways 6 Feet Non Slip Hallway Runner Rugs with Rubber Backing Long Kitchen Runner Rug Non Skid Washable Long Carpet Ru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N+KzJpZ4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Combine with a classic medallion and comfort border come alive with a floral element to play up this rug’s classy look. This immediately adds warmth, style, and ultimate coziness to your home; Sleek pile height allows for seamless placement in entryways and underneath furniture, Noise tends to echo on hardwood floors in apartments, but putting a rug in your home will help you dampen vibrations thus helping reduce sound transfer to some extent; Protecting wood floors from scratches and other damage. Providing a protective barrier against furniture legs, foot traffic, and pets. Note: Since the rug is folded and shipped, it may be wrinkled. But don't worry, it will return to its original shape after a few days. You can try loosely rolling the rug back in the opposite direction, laying it upside down, or using heavy plants, books, upturned furniture, or mattresses to push back on the fibers to help the rug relax quickly. Or you can use low-temperature ironing to restore it. How to care： To wash it, please use a delicate cycle with a gentle detergent. If you don't mind risking shrinkage of 1 inch, you can just wash it as you would wash any dark-colored cotton items. However, we recommend letting it dry outside as a drier will most certainly shrink the rug a little. You can stretch the rug or iron it at low heat to return it to its original form.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N+KzJpZ4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOZYFLY","source_asin":"B08B7YK22K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B7YK22K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B7YK22K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
