window.products.push({"id":427275,"name":"Electric Lunch Box Food Heater, 1.8 L Large Capacity Portable Electric Food Warmer, 60W Faster Heated Lunch Boxes for Adults, 110/12/24V 3 in 1 Leak P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716gtJwZkwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60W High-Power & PTC Fast Heating: Our portable electric lunch box food heater has a high power of 60W, it adopts constant temperature PTC heating and a low heat consumption cycle, which can be quickly heated to the optimal temperature within 25-40 minutes. At the same time, it will always maintain a constant temperature state to keep your food hydrated and fresh. 1.8L Large Capacity Design: WIRELEL electric food warmer lunch box is designed with the latest 1.8L(20% more than others) large capacity to meet the needs of more users, don't worry about not having enough food anymore. In addition, we provide a 0.45L plastic compartment which can be used to separate different kinds of food. A spoon and fork on the lid, you can also use it as a cell phone stand to watch movies while eating. 3 In 1 Electric Lunch Box: The lunch box heater portable contains two different plugs: one for work/home (110V) and one for car/truck (12v/24v). No microwave required, just plug in the power supply, the car/trucker drivers can eat home cooked warm meal healthily on the go, and the office workers/construction worker/students no longer need to spend a lot of time queuing in crowded restaurants. Leak-proof Design: In order to have better sealing, the lids of our lunch boxes are equipped with snaps on all sides, and a built-in rubber sealing ring is added at the same time, So there is no need to worry about liquid food spilling out in an environment where the car is shaking. Excellent Quality & Perfect Gift Idea: The heated lunch box is made of food-grade PP material and 304 food-grade stainless steel. It has strong heat resistance, detachable and easy to clean, no peculiar smell and durable! Whether you're looking for the perfect gift for your husband, boyfriend, dad, and friends, or for yourself on the go, look no further, WIRELEL heated lunch boxe will surprise you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716gtJwZkwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WIRELEL","source_asin":"B0B3TDPBZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3TDPBZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3TDPBZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
