window.products.push({"id":427369,"name":"Uber Appliance UB-CH1-MB, Skin Care, Beauty, Makeup, Cosmetics Storage | Skincare Bedroom | Portable Mini Fridge Cooler and Warmer, 4L, blackout matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811YTvrCnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Uber Chill Mini Fridge is designed to be as versatile as you are! This portable mini fridge was designed with multiple uses in mind. From keeping your cosmetics and skin care products stored properly, to providing you with the convenience of your favorite snacks and drinks within arms reach. Wether you choose to use our mini fridges for your beauty routine or you are looking for a portable refrigerator for car, we got you covered! we design our products to be convenient, sleek and comfortable to meet all of your daily needs. We understand how unique your lifestyle is so we designed a fridge just as unique as you are! What are you waiting for? pick one up for yourself and your family members! The Uber Chill Mini Fridge makes for a unique gift that any one will love and appreciate!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811YTvrCnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uber Appliance","source_asin":"B07C5W1R7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C5W1R7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C5W1R7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427370,"name":"Stanbroil 235 PCS Tourmaline Balls Mineral Balls Aquarium Tank Balls Calcium Supplement Mineral Balls for Freshwater Aquarium Tank Fish Tank Shrimp Cr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LVtWmCITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR MARINE ANIMALS: Tourmaline balls can help clean the water, and keep your tank out of impurities; The tourmaline balls can also release mineral elements such as K. Ca. Na. Mq Zn. Fe, which has positive effect on promoting the growth and health of fish. Just like vitamins, minerals and water for humans, your shrimp, bettas, crayfish and snails also need those mineral balls for bright colors, healthy breeding, molting and playing. IMITATE WILDLIFE HADITAT: Out in the wild, cherry shrimp, ghost shrimp, amano shrimp, freshwater fish and all other water-lovin’ life are constantly exposed to pH balanced, mineral water from earth’s rocks – with natural bacteria. This is how they molt, breed and maintain healthy vibrancy. Our organic tourmaline is a natural rock with over 30 minerals to keep your tank balanced just like those wild waters. AQUARIUM DECOR THAT GOES WELL WITH LIVE DECOR: side from great health benefits, these energy balls would look great in your tanks too. Its round shape and color fit perfectly to any theme you want to convey by giving a distinct look and feel. ENHANCE WATER QUALITY: Contains both positive and negative poles, these tourmaline balls help in improving the water quality. These balls are also rich in calcium and help maintain the water parameters of the tank that are ideal for bettas. MULTIPLE USE: If you place these balls in substrate near plants, they will also soak up the beneficial elements. In addition, they can also be used in fire pit, fireplace and flowerpot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LVtWmCITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stanbroil","source_asin":"B08X21MKWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X21MKWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X21MKWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
