window.products.push({"id":427459,"name":"Rhino Trunk & Case Dance Star Wardrobe Trunk with Mounted Wheels, Competitions, Recitals, & Performances 35\"x21\"x16\" (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESZIKdjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rhino Dance Star Leather Embossed Vinyl – water, scratch and dent resistant laminate provides a durable, easy to clean colorful finish. DANCE STAR WARDROBE TRUNK FOR DANCE COMPETITIONS & RECITALS - This dance star wardrobe trunk is fit for the stars! Hand-crafted in the USA with Baltic Birch hardwood plywood, heavy duty nickel-plated steel hardware, and a heavy-duty vinyl exterior that is highly resistant to water penetration, denting, and scratching. Specially designed to withstand shipping and transport. DANCE STAR TRUNK FOR PERFORMANCE ROAD TRIPS - This dance star wardrobe trunk is the ultimate way to pack for competitions, recitals, and performance road trips, this trunk also functions as a stylish and sturdy stand-up closet for the dressing room. When full, the included aluminum clothing rod doubles as an effective privacy screen for costume changes. DANCE STAR WARDROBE TRUNK FOR DANCERS - This dance star wardrobe trunk allows you to pack everything you need, and then some! Roomy interior fits clothes, costumes, accessories, props, and supplies, while an expandable 360-degree swivel clothing rod, an interior clothing rod, and five removable canvas drawers keep everything neat, organized, and wrinkle-free. Light gray interior makes it easy to see all outfits and accessories. DANCE STAR WARDROBE TRUNK FOR PERFORMERS - This dance star wardrobe trunk keeps items safe and secure at all times with a stylish trunk padlock loop that adds extra security and peace of mind. Tight-fitting tongue and groove lid-to-base closure protects items by keeping out moisture, dirt, insects, and odors. INCLUDES HIGH QUALITY MOUNTED WHEELS & GENUINE LEATHER HANDLES - Strong steel and genuine leather handles, 250 pound-rated integrated wheels, and an empty weight of 44 pounds make this Made in the USA dance star wardrobe trunk ideal for loading into and out of the car, carrying up and down flights of stairs, and rolling or stowing away for easy storage and transportation. Due to its size, it is not ideal for air travel or general tourist travel. It is not a replacement for luggage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESZIKdjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhino Trunk & Case","source_asin":"B01MUI0GXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MUI0GXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MUI0GXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
