window.products.push({"id":427570,"name":"Kitchen + Home Silicone Baking Mat - Non-stick Small Silicone Mat for Toaster Oven - Contains NO BPA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6195rh4JEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silicone Baking Mat - Non-stick Small Silicone Mat BPA FREE HIGH QUALITY, PROFESSIONAL-GRADE SILICONE BAKING MAT (BAKING SHEET, COOKIE SHEET). Use this resistant mat as a baking tray liner for non-stick baking in conventional ovens. Temperatures supported range from -30 ºF t o 400 ºF. With a smaller size of 9\" x 12\" it fits perfectly smaller sized sheet pans. Also fits into a toaster oven! NON-TOXIC, ECO-FRIENDLY PRODUCT. Made with non-toxic materials, free from BPA and other harmful materials (contains no plastic) LFGB certified. Eliminates the use of parchment paper, which makes it an environmentally friendly product. NON-STICK. Remove food easily after baking. No more stained baking pans! EASY CARE. Just wash with water and dish detergent using a soft cloth or sponge and let air-dry. Not intended to be used as a toaster oven liner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6195rh4JEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen + Home","source_asin":"B00TXRS2W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TXRS2W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TXRS2W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427571,"name":"Made in Mexico Piedra Negra Black Stone Genuine Mexican Manual Guacamole Salsa Maker Volcanic Lava Rock Molcajete/Tejolote Mortar and Pestle Herbs Spi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-pRhgGHYL._SL1073_.jpg","description":"This is the black stone Piedra Negra model which even-though it is grey color as pictured it will little by little become darker as you use it. This model is better quality than normal molcajetes because you can put it in the oven and the heat from the oven will not damage it. They are hand made and some have little extra things on them like a little partial face or tail of a pig and some don't. They come mixed in a batch directly from Mexico so we can't pick and choose. They are all round as pictured though. When it comes to guacamole Mexican's are the experts. You can not buy a Chinese made guacamole maker and expect an authentic taste or experience. This is made in mexico from the volcanic granite lava and according to mexican chefs every time you make food it it, a little bit of the stone taste gets mixed with the food which gives it the special authentic taste. This will make a great party show off piece as well as a great device for your kitchen to make authentic mexican foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-pRhgGHYL._SL1073_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"always-quality","source_asin":"B07DS134HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DS134HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DS134HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427572,"name":"New Shaggy Collection Solid Color Shag Rug Options Available (Burnt Orange, 5' Round)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LAOnsuCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rug Styles New Shaggy Collection is machine-made in Turkey using 100% heat-set polypropylene by Rug Styles. These contemporary shag / shaggy rugs will make a colorful and exciting addition to any area. Vibrant solid colors . Color : Burnt Orange . Backing : Jute Backing (In order to prevent movement on hardwood, marble floor etc rug pad is required, not included) --- Care instructions: Vacuum and rotate the rug regularly. Remove dried spots immediately by scraping carefully towards the middle of the spot. Do not rub wet spots. Absorb moisture with paper towels, and clean with a damp cloth and mild detergent. Professional carpet cleaning when needed. Spot cleaning with mild soap and damp cloth. This rug is not machine washable. Please Note: We try to display the most accurate color possible however due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen. Please be advised that in some cases patterns and colors may vary according to size. Lengths and widths may vary from the published dimensions. We do our best to provide you with an accurate measurement, but please be advised that rug size is approximate (±3% due to manufacturing) and this is not a manufacturing defect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LAOnsuCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RugStylesOnline","source_asin":"B01CTE4QNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CTE4QNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CTE4QNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
