window.products.push({"id":427582,"name":"Wanderlust - 8 Oz - Soy Wax Scented Candle with 100% Pure Essential Oils (Cedarwood, Pine, Cypress and Frankicense), Aromatherapy, Reusable Tumbler wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gXGCcFIfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Light this candle and inhale the wave of wanderlust as you are transported to the wild outdoors with soft, green, woody notes. Our custom blend of cypress, cedarwood, pine and frankincense essential oils is grounding and soothing, providing a clean and fresh aroma. All-Botanical Ingredients: Cypress Essential Oil, Cedarwood Essential Oil, ﻿Pine Essential Oil, Frankincense Essential Oil, Soy Wax, and Coconut Oil Natural Simplicity Slow North is dedicated to creating the finest plant-based candles for your home. From our soy wax to our cotton and paper wicks to our 100% essential oil fragrances, our products define a new level of all-natural luxury. Soy wax is a long-burning, biodegradable and renewable resource. Our candles are vegan and free of phthalates, artificial fragrances, and petroleum by-products. Burn time is up to 35 hours. Essential Oils Our Wanderlust aromatherapeutic candles are only scented with essential oils, which are naturally-occurring fragrant oils produced in the cells of aromatic plants. The fragrant oils are extracted from the plants by one of two premium methods available: steam distillation or expression (a.k.a. cold pressed). Mindful Details These 8 oz candles are hand-poured into reusable, frosted glass tumblers made in the USA and are topped with an environmentally-friendly cork lid. Cork is considered a sustainable resource because it doesn't involve cutting down the tree to harvest the cork. Instead, it's harvested by stripping the bark as the tree continues to live and grow. In a world crowded by artificial fragrances and over-stimulation, your senses and your wellbeing will thank you for choosing Slow North.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gXGCcFIfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slow North","source_asin":"B013CO8A0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013CO8A0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013CO8A0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
