window.products.push({"id":427654,"name":"Magnolias After The Rain I Canvas Wall Art Print, Magnolia Artwork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moCNFJTjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIZE: 24\" W x 24\" H x 1.25\" D. Orientation of canvas is square. READY TO HANG: Canvas comes with pre-installed hanging hardware already attached to the back of the product, so all that remains once received is hanging a nail on your wall for final installation. Infographic for hardware shown in product images. MADE IN USA: Canvas is handcrafted and made-to-order in the United States using high quality artist-grade canvas and archival inks that prevent against fading and preserve as much fine detail and vivid color as possible. Product also comes with a finished back. PERFECT FOR ANY SPACE: Living room, family room, bedroom, bathroom, office, kitchen, dining room, game room, bar, and more! SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Please note that screens can vary in color and brightness, which can cause some printed products to appear slightly different from the online preview. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us directly through your order history and we would be more than happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moCNFJTjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANVAS ON DEMAND","source_asin":"B084G95HSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084G95HSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084G95HSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427655,"name":"MINI HEAT SEALER (2 PACK) – PREMIUM SEALING FOR FOOD STORAGE, CHIPS, CANDY, SNACKS, GROCERIES, PLASTIC BAGS – PORTABLE SEAL AND RESEAL FOR AIRTIGHT LO","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ast6t7X+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT ✅You’ll receive TWO Mini Heat Sealers in the color mixture of Lavender Purple and Teal Blue. ✅Each Mini Heat Sealer is built with a heating clip and is made out of Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene (ABS).  ✅ABS is an opaque thermoplastic and amorphous polymer. This characteristic allows the heating, cooling, and reheating of compatible material at the approximate temperature of 221 degrees Fahrenheit. ✅We choose ABS because it is harmless in that it does not contain any known carcinogens, and adverse health effects. WHERE ✅The MHS is great in the household with any leftover food or snacks. ✅The MHS is great for keeping at work when you want to keep your snacks fresh for the days to come.  ✅The MHS is great for adventures on vacations or campers that want to make sure the food smell is minimalized to the animals. HOW ✅1)Insert 2 AA Batteries (Batteries Not Included) ✅2)Unlock Safety/Protective Cap to Down Position ✅3)Press Down on Sealer to Preheat 5-7 Seconds ✅4)Flatten Out Surface of Desired Bag to be Sealed ✅5)Apply Sealer to Bag and Firmly Press Down ✅6)While Pressing Down, Move Moderately from One End to Another ✅7)Move Protective Cap Back to Up Position ❗DO NOT TOUCH HEATING CLIP WHILE OPERATING! CAN CAUSE PAIN AND INJURY❗ WHY ✅Keep our groceries, candies, chips, and edibles fresher for a longer period of time in a vacuum tight seal. ✅Prevent the surprise of eating something stale or rotten. ✅Reduce the need for constant purchasing of food. ✅Save $$$. ABOUT US ✅✅✅No matter what, we are consumers first and will always keep the consumers' mindset. Your satisfaction is #1 to us. If for whatever reason you are not satisfied, please contact and let us know. We promise to make it better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ast6t7X+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoJT","source_asin":"B07BJ53PDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BJ53PDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BJ53PDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
