window.products.push({"id":427715,"name":"ENETIX 6-Pack 100% Cotton Kitchen Dish Towels, Ultra Soft Absorbent Quick Drying Waffle Weave Dish Cloths (10 x 20 Inches, Mixed Color)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDH02w-iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton 【100% Natural Cotton】Made of 100% natural ring spun cotton, our kitchen dish towels meet all your daily household needs. Tightly woven in waffle pattern and 60% more absorbent, make it an ideal alternative to paper towels. 【Ultra Absorbent】Unique waffle pattern, designed to soak up more liquid than regular towels. Much more lightweight, soft and breathable. Perfect for drying dishes, glasses, or any other tableware. 【Easy Care】Our cotton dishcloths are long lasting and durable, stay functional and fresh after many washes. In order to minimize shrinkage, improve absorbency and reduce lint, please wash in cold water before first use. 【Multi-Purpose 】This cotton towel is perfectly designed for multi-purpose use. 10 × 20‘’ sized towels are ideal for cleaning dishes, countertops, cookware and all your household appliance. 【Value Pack & Perfect Gift Idea】 Enetix pack of 6 dish towels come with elegant packaging. An excellent gift for mother's day, hostess, housewarming, holidays or any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDH02w-iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENETIX","source_asin":"B08HLN9211","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HLN9211","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HLN9211","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427716,"name":"MIZGI Premium Velvet Hangers - Pack of 50 - Gray - Copper/Rose Gold Hooks - Non-Slip Suit Hangers, Clothes Hangers Bonus Accessory Bar for Suits, Pant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SuHBeQCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Full Adult Standard Size】- (LxWxH):17.5\"x0.2\"x9\" inches.Top Quality ABS Plastic,Gray Nylon Flocked,360 degree rotated swivel Rose Gold Hook/Copper hook.VALUE PACK of 50 pcs ✔【Double maximize closet space】 - Designed velvet hangers Increases Closet space by as much as 50 percent.The slim and sleek design works for your closet efficiently, maximizing space and adding class, helping you organize your wardrobe in the most space efficient manner ✔【Super Strong】- MIZGI huggable velvet hangers with 2023 NEWLY improved quality made of premium grade plastic. Rest assure that it will steadily hold even the heaviest clothes in your closet, can hold large capacity from 5kg to 8kg(11lbs to 18lbs).It is stronger and much lighter than wooden suit hangers but sturdy to hold heavy coats without getting bent ✔【Accessory bar & Ergonomic design】- Internal tie bar and accessory scarf holder organize your favorite ties or scarves for sorting outfits, what's more, it helps the felt hangers stay sturdy and straight.Contoured shoulder helps keep your clothes in their natural shapes and soft velvet leaves no shoulder bumps or pants creases, precisely-cut notches perfect for hanging straps of tank tops and camisoles ✔【Nonslip】 - Supreme soft luxurious velvet flocked instead of plastic or metal leaves no crease on the pant when you fold them over.Prevents slippery or wide neck clothes from slipping off the flocked hangers, no shedding or fading on your white clothes with latest flocking technique. Great coat hangers for suits, shirts, coats, sweaters, skirts, dresses and pants etc ✔【Assured Brand】- MIZGI is different kind of Company that prides itself in providing the absolute best customer service , if you have any questions about this boutique hangers and it is not suitable for you. Send 1 simple email to Clicking \"Ask seller\" and received a 100% money back. (In fact, you do not need to send back)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SuHBeQCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIZGI","source_asin":"B07H2VFKYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H2VFKYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H2VFKYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
