window.products.push({"id":427750,"name":"Amorho LED Bathroom Mirror 55\"x 30\", Backlit + Front-Lighted Vanity Mirror, Dimmable Bathroom Mirrors for Wall, Anti-Fog, Memory, 3 Colors, Double LED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":419.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZY6pzoHtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Lights & Super Bright】- With two built-in LED strip lights, Amorho LED lighted bathroom mirror gives out twice the lighting, both from backsides and front. The lighting mirrors are bright enough for makeup or shave or beauty care. No dark, no shadow, supper clear. 【Shatterproof & Corrosion Proof】- Will you worried about the breakage of the mirror glass and the relative troubles. Our mirror is made from stronger glass, that is armored glass. It will not get broken easily. Even it is broken, it will not shatter to piece, no harm, more safe to use. With epoxy coat, this mirror is corrosion proof. It will not get corroded after 30days acid test. 【Colors Changeable and Brightness Dimmable】- This LED illuminated mirror is multifunctional. You can press the button to change the color temperatures: Warm(3000K), natural (4000K) and white(6000K). You can also dim the bright to your comfortable level. All these will be easily controlled by the touch button. The smart memory function will record the lighting setting and keep the previous lighting status after turning off and on. 【Easy to Install and Powered by Plugin or Hard Wire】- Fixed the mirror holder on the wall by screws and hang the mirror on the holder. You can use the plug for power or connect the wire to wall switch by hard wire. It is better done by a professional electrician if you want to hardwire it. 【3 Year Warranty】-We will provide 3 years warranty for Amorho LED lighted mirrors. For any doubts and questions, please feel free to contact us. We welcome all the recommendations for mirror improvement. Our Mission is to produce the beautiful, modern, safe mirror for you. 💙Tips: If you want to turned off the blue lights of the controls, just long-press the botton till it off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZY6pzoHtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amorho","source_asin":"B0B92BBHC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B92BBHC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B92BBHC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
